cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "kac-zwanzig: an exactly solvable Kac-Zwanzig model"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pfalzgraff
    given-names: William C.
    affiliation: Chatham University
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8404-4809
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-09-10
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/william-pfalzgraff/kac-zwanzig
url: https://github.com/william-pfalzgraff/kac-zwanzig
abstract: >-
  A Python package that generates exact memory kernels, velocity autocorrelation
  functions and trajectories for a particle linearly coupled to a bath of harmonic
  oscillators, plus sampled correlation functions with controllable statistical noise.
keywords:
  - generalized Langevin equation
  - memory kernel
  - Kac-Zwanzig model
  - harmonic bath
  - velocity autocorrelation function
